"It facilitates the applicant admission\n"
"                                        process."
msgstr ""
"Es erleichtert den Zulassungsprozess von\n"
"                                        Studienbewerbern."

#. module: openeducat_core
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:openeducat_core.res_config_settings_view_form_core
